-- Listings in the wrong category, found by checking every listing's title against its category and confirming each
-- by hand (6 November 2026). Most came from eBay's own categories: automatic gearboxes filed under "Gearboxes, Racks &
-- Pinions" (steering), doors under body panels or interior, airbag control modules under interior, and engine and
-- cooling parts under "other car parts & accessories". Each move only applies while the listing is still in the
-- category it was found in, so a category staff have since changed is left alone. updated_at isn't touched: the eBay
-- sync compares it with ebay_synced_at.
